OL,3,GNEWSAPolice find no criminality in Yes
OL,4,AScotland finances
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say they have "not identified
OL,7,Fany criminality" following a complaint
OL,8,Fabout the finances of independence
OL,9,Fcampaign group Yes Scotland.
OL,11,FIn July, a Sunday newspaper published
OL,12,Fclaims by an activist that it was not
OL,13,Fknown how income of more than #1.5m had
OL,14,Fbeen spent.
OL,16,FHowever, Police Scotland say the
OL,17,Finformation passed to them has been
OL,18,Fassessed and does not warrant further
OL,19,Finquiries.
